# mutual_recursion — mutually recursive operations
# (README §13). Tests isEven/isOdd pattern.

MutualRecursion is project
MutualRecursion module examplesMutualRecursion
MutualRecursion target console
MutualRecursion entry main

examplesMutualRecursion is module
examplesMutualRecursion path examples.mutualRecursion
examplesMutualRecursion exports main
examplesMutualRecursion purpose "Demonstrate mutual recursion pattern"
examplesMutualRecursion invariant "isEven/isOdd work correctly"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Determine if a number is even via mutual recursion"
main invariant "4 is even"

main let result immutable Int64 1
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printResult
main return okCode

printResult is call
printResult in main
printResult invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printResult arg value Int64 result
